</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/deeffb42-7585-11f1-a348-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/desss.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/deeffb42-7585-11f1-a348-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/desss.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">a9c90dd6-7581-11f1-9b50-b3014d8f5ed0</guid><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 20:03:05 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/deeffb42-7585-11f1-a348-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/desss.jpg">AFP - ODD ANDERSEN</source><dc:creator>Paul Myers</dc:creator></item><item><category>Sports</category><title>United States battle past Bosnia and Herzegovina into last 16 clash with Belgium</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/sports/20260702-united-states-battle-past-bosnia-and-herzegovina-into-last-16-clash-with-belgium</link><description>
